/aitchiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2021-06-09T11:17:01Z","updated_at":"2021-08-09T15:00:02Z","closed_at":"2021-08-09T15:00:02Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In the post editor, we allow a user to upload:\r\n\r\n- a cover image via the \"Add a cover image\" button\r\n- any other images via the \"Upload image\" button\r\n\r\nIn both cases, the HTML markup is a `button` element with an `input` descendant. It's not valid HTML to nest interactive items inside each other like this, and this [can cause accessibility issues with screen reading software](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.2/nested-interactive?application=AxeChrome).\r\n\r\nThe nesting in this particular case is also causing some unfortunate accessible names on these button elements, for example:\r\n\r\n![screenshot showing the 'upload image' button is announced via VoiceOver as \"upload image upload image upload an image button\"](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/20773163/121344633-e5b3d500-c91b-11eb-91a9-23af12b07f46.png)\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior after refactor\r\n\r\n- The buttons no longer have inputs as descendants\r\n- The current visual style is maintained\r\n- Accessible names for the controls are logical and announced via screen reader\r\n- Mobile functionality, including that in the mobile app, are unaffected (NB: the app handles image upload natively, and we need to be careful not to regress this behavior. Any PR addressing this will need tested in both desktop/mobile web and in the native app)\r\n- \"Upload image\" functionality works by both keyboard and mouse\r\n\r\n## Other context\r\n\r\nAfter an upgrade to `axe-core`, this markup started causing our frontend tests to fail in the following files:\r\n- `app/javascript/article-form/components/__tests__/ImageUploader.test.jsx`\r\n- `app/javascript/article-form/components/__tests__/ArticleCoverImage.test.jsx` \r\n- `app/javascript/article-form/components/__tests__/Form.test.jsx`\r\n\r\n\r\nThe fix for this issue should reinstate the normal axe rules for this test.","closed_by":{"login":"aitchiss","id":20773163,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzczMTYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20773163?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss","html_url":"https://github.com/aitchiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitchiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/forem/forem/issues/13947/reaction